				<wikidot:authorName>RJB_R</wikidot:authorName>				<wikidot:authorUserId>1229263</wikidot:authorUserId>				<content:encoded>
					<![CDATA[
						 <p>So, alright guys, here it is.</p> <p>I have found the Administrator.</p> <p>He is also FritzWillie.</p> <p>I'd been searching the FritzWillie username for quite some time, only to come up empty handed with old abandoned accounts. However, last night, I managed to contact an active steam account with the username. I messaged the guy, and we had a conversation. He confirmed to me that he was, in fact, the original FritzWillie, but that he was also The Administrator.</p> <p>He came into a chatroom last night briefly, and verified his claims. I talked to him briefly, and will do a more complete interview to get more details on the early days. But, yeah, he's alive and backish.</p> 
				 	]]>
				</content:encoded>							</item>
